      "updated": 1788587292534,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14.853583542790208,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "WORKING SCHEDULE NOTE\n• Required views: List and Form. The List is for finding/opening schedules; the Form defines one schedule.\n• A schedule should capture the weekly working pattern (days, working time and total weekly hours). Breaks or variable shifts can be handled in your own way.\n• Employee/Contract can reference a Working Schedule. Attendance and Payroll may use it as the expected working time.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WORKING SCHEDULE NOTE\n• Required views: List and Form. The List is for finding/opening schedules; the Form defines one schedule.\n• A schedule should capture the weekly working pattern (days, working time and total weekly hours). Breaks or variable shifts can be handled in your own way.\n• Employee/Contract can reference a Working Schedule. Attendance and Payroll may use it as the expected working time.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 71
    },
