      "updated": 1788433892440,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• In the ERP flow. User accounts are created by an Admin.\n• When creating a user, link the account to the relevant employee and assign one or more roles.\n• Roles control which modules, records and actions become available after login.\n• Users must not be able to assign or elevate their own roles.\n• Password reset, invitations, SSO, etc. can be added as enhancements.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "VpzcxjF4UJDPZJZYzFeJ8",
      "originalText": "• In the ERP flow. User accounts are created by an Admin.\n• When creating a user, link the account to the relevant employee and assign one or more roles.\n• Roles control which modules, records and actions become available after login.\n• Users must not be able to assign or elevate their own roles.\n• Password reset, invitations, SSO, etc. can be added as enhancements.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 97
    },
